    "title": "L.A. County Declares July 15 'Wallis Annenberg Day' in Honor of Late Philanthropist - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By India Brown ,\n12 hours ago Southern Californians just got a new summer holiday. The County of Los Angeles and the cities of Los Angeles, Santa Monica and Beverly Hills have officially proclaimed July 15 as “Wallis Annenberg Day” in honor of the late civic leader and daughter of TV Guide founder Walter Annenberg. Read full article\n2",
